html
  head
    meta(charset='utf-8')
    link(rel='icon', href='/icons/favicon.ico?v={{V}}', sizes='any')
    link(rel='icon', type='image/png', sizes='32x32', href='/icons/icon-32.png?v={{V}}')
    link(rel='icon', type='image/png', sizes='192x192', href='/icons/icon-192.png?v={{V}}')
    link(rel='apple-touch-icon', href='/icons/icon-180.png?v={{V}}')
    meta(
      name='viewport',
      content='width=device-width, height=device-height, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=0'
    )
    script(
      src='/vendor/jquery/jquery-3.6.0.min.js?v={{V}}',
      integrity='sha384-vtXRMe3mGCbOeY7l30aIg8H9p3GdeSe4IFlP6G8JMa7o7lXvnz3GFKzPxzJdPfGK',
      crossorigin='anonymous',
      referrerpolicy='no-referrer'
    )
    link(rel='stylesheet', href='/main.css?v={{V}}')
    link(rel='stylesheet', href='/styles/rating.css?v={{V}}')
    link(rel='stylesheet', href='/vendor/katex/katex.min.css?v={{V}}')
    link(rel='stylesheet', href='/styles/profile.css?v={{V}}')
    title Roka - 个人主页
  body.profile
    div.profile-wrap
      header.profile-topbar
        button#back-home-btn.btn.btn-ghost.btn-sm(type='button') ← 返回首页
        span
          a#account-name(href='#')
          a#login-btn.btn.btn-primary.btn-sm(href='/login', style='display: none') 登录
      div#profile-not-found.card(style='display: none')
        p.panel-empty 用户不存在。
      div#profile-main.profile-columns(style='display: none')
        aside.profile-column.profile-column-left
          section.card
            div
              span#p-name.profile-name
              span#p-title.profile-title
            a#p-github-link.profile-github-link(
              href='#',
              target='_blank',
              rel='noopener noreferrer',
              style='display: none'
            )
            div.profile-stats.profile-stats-peak
              div.profile-stat
                div#p-max-rating.profile-stat-value -
                div.profile-stat-label 最高 Rating
              div.profile-stat
                div#p-rating.profile-stat-value -
                div.profile-stat-label 当前 Rating
            div.profile-stats
              div.profile-stat
                div#p-level.profile-stat-value -
                div.profile-stat-label 对局数
              div.profile-stat
                div#p-days.profile-stat-value -
                div.profile-stat-label 注册天数
              div.profile-stat
                div#p-rating-rank.profile-stat-value -
                div.profile-stat-label Rating 排名
            div.points-level-card
              div.points-level-head
                span.points-level-title
                  | Lv&#32;
                  strong#p-level-label -
                span.points-total
                  strong#p-points 0
                  | &#32;积分
              div.points-progress
                span#p-level-progress
              div#p-level-next.points-level-next -
            div#rating-changes.rating-changes(style='display: none')
              div.rating-changes-title 最近 Rating 变更
              ul#rating-changes-list.rating-changes-list
          section#github-link-card.card(style='display: none')
            h2.card-title GitHub 绑定
            p#github-not-configured.github-link-note(style='display: none')
              | &#32;管理员尚未配置 GitHub OAuth，暂不能绑定或换绑。&#32;
            div#github-linked-view(style='display: none')
              a#github-account-link(href='#', target='_blank', rel='noopener noreferrer')
              p#github-star-state.github-link-note
              p#github-star-verified.github-link-meta
            p#github-unlinked-view.github-link-note(style='display: none')
              | &#32;绑定 GitHub 后，可以在个人主页展示链接；Star Roka 并通过核验后，名字首字母会变为金色。&#32;
            div.github-link-actions
              button#github-bind-btn.btn.btn-primary.btn-sm(type='button') 绑定 GitHub
              button#github-star-refresh-btn.btn.btn-secondary.btn-sm(type='button')
                | &#32;刷新 Star 状态&#32;
              button#github-unlink-btn.btn.btn-ghost.btn-sm(type='button') 解绑
            a#github-repo-link.github-repo-link(
              href='https://github.com/oimasterkafuu/Roka',
              target='_blank',
              rel='noopener noreferrer'
            ) 前往 GitHub 为 Roka 点 Star ↗
            p#github-action-status.github-action-status(role='status', aria-live='polite')
          section#ambassador-card.card
            div.ambassador-heading
              h2.card-title 推广大使
              span#ambassador-badge.ambassador-badge(style='display: none')
            p#ambassador-summary.ambassador-summary 还没有有效邀请。
            a.ambassador-wall-link(href='/ambassadors') 查看推广大使感谢墙 →
            div#referral-share(style='display: none')
              label.referral-share-label(for='referral-link') 我的邀请链接
              div.referral-share-row
                input#referral-link(type='text', readonly)
                = ' '
                button#referral-copy.btn.btn-secondary.btn-sm(type='button') 复制
              p.referral-share-note
                | &#32;新玩家通过链接注册并完成首次有效对局后激活。仅提供纪念徽章，不增加 Rating 或积分。&#32;
          section.card
            h2.card-title Rating 历史
            div#rating-chart
            p#rating-chart-empty.panel-empty(style='display: none') 暂无 Rating 记录。
        main.profile-column.profile-column-center
          section.card
            h2.card-title 他的动态
            div#feed-list
            div#feed-empty.feed-empty(style='display: none') TA 还没有发布动态。
            div#feed-pager.feed-pager(style='display: none')
        aside.profile-column.profile-column-right
          section.card
            h2.card-title 他的回放
            table.mini-table
              thead
                tr
                  th 时间
                  th 回合
                  th 结果
              tbody#replays-body
            p#replays-empty.panel-empty(style='display: none') 暂无回放。
            div.panel-pager
              button#replays-prev.btn.btn-secondary.btn-sm(type='button', disabled)
                | &#32;上一页&#32;
              button#replays-next.btn.btn-secondary.btn-sm(type='button', disabled)
                | &#32;下一页&#32;
    script(
      src='/vendor/socket.io/socket.io-4.0.1.js?v={{V}}',
      integrity='sha384-ZCmVL/dTQHh41JxtZe73klDRFSJ/zixGCGt5lhnLQGjSWfAnlXSg+GSnRACaK5lc',
      crossorigin='anonymous',
      referrerpolicy='no-referrer'
    )
    script(src='/username.js?v={{V}}')
    script(src='/mention-autocomplete.js?v={{V}}')
    script(src='/profile.js?v={{V}}')
